# Sample MCP Initialize Request
File: mcp/examples/initialize_request.oot

## Request

```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "initialize",
  "params": {
    "protocolVersion": "2024-11-05",
    "capabilities": {},
    "clientInfo": {"name": "openooda-mcp-client", "version": "0.1.0"}
  }
}
```

## Expected result fields

protocolVersion: 2024-11-05

serverInfo.name: openOODA MCP Server

capabilities.tools, capabilities.resources, capabilities.prompts present.

sampling is absent.
